event: complete
data: ["<div class='lra-lb' id='lra-lb-closed'><div class='lra-table-wrap'><table class='lra-table'><thead><tr><th data-col='rank' data-sortable='1' class='lra-thcell'><span class='lra-th'><span class='lra-th-label'>#</span><span class='lra-sort'></span></span></th><th data-col='user' data-sortable='1' class='lra-thcell'><span class='lra-th'><span class='lra-th-label'>Submitter</span><span class='lra-sort'></span></span></th><th data-col='model' data-sortable='1' class='lra-thcell has-tip'><span class='lra-th'><span class='lra-th-label'>Model & reasoning</span><span class='lra-sort'></span></span><div class='lra-tip'>Optional model and reasoning effort/settings reported by the participant. These details are not verified and do not affect scoring.</div></th><th data-col='combined' data-sortable='1' class='lra-thcell has-tip'><span class='lra-th'><span class='lra-th-label'>Combined %</span><span class='lra-better' title='Higher is better'>(\u2191)</span><span class='lra-sort'></span></span><div class='lra-tip'>Each problem scores the mean of its three axes; this is the mean of those problem scores over the whole benchmark. A problem with no submission scores 0 and is still averaged in.</div></th><th data-col='length' data-sortable='1' class='lra-thcell has-tip'><span class='lra-th'><span class='lra-th-label'>Length reduction %</span><span class='lra-better' title='Higher is better'>(\u2191)</span><span class='lra-sort'></span></span><div class='lra-tip'>Decrease in proof token counts compared against the original proof before refactoring. Higher is better.</div></th><th data-col='heartbeat' data-sortable='1' class='lra-thcell has-tip'><span class='lra-th'><span class='lra-th-label'>Heartbeat reduction %</span><span class='lra-better' title='Higher is better'>(\u2191)</span><span class='lra-sort'></span></span><div class='lra-tip'>Change in Lean's <a href='https://lean-lang.org/doc/reference/latest/IO/Timing/#IO___getNumHeartbeats' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'><code>#count_heartbeats</code></a>, the number of \u201csmall\u201d memory allocations performed on the current execution thread. Positive values indicate cheaper (typically faster) compilation; negative values indicate costlier compilation.</div></th><th data-col='zeroshot' data-sortable='1' class='lra-thcell has-tip'><span class='lra-th'><span class='lra-th-label'>Zero-shot %</span><span class='lra-better' title='Higher is better'>(\u2191)</span><span class='lra-sort'></span></span><div class='lra-tip'>Share of a problem's listed Lean toolchains on which the accepted proof compiles unchanged, averaged over the whole benchmark. A problem that was not submitted or did not compile counts 0.</div></th><th data-col='submitted' data-sortable='1' class='lra-thcell'><span class='lra-th'><span class='lra-th-label'>Submitted</span><span class='lra-sort'></span></span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-rank='1'><td class='rank' data-col='rank' data-sort='1'>1</td><td class='who' data-col='user' data-sort='bob2'>Bob2</td><td class='model' data-col='model' data-sort=''><span class='lra-na'>\u2014</span></td><td data-col='combined' data-sort='94.13'><div class='lra-cell-num'>94.13%</div><div class='lra-bar'><span style='width:94.1%'></span></div></td><td data-col='length' data-sort='92.17'><div class='lra-cell-num'>92.17%</div><div class='lra-bar'><span style='width:92.2%'></span></div></td><td data-col='heartbeat' data-sort='90.22'><div class='lra-cell-num'>90.22%</div><div class='lra-bar diverging'><span class='lra-bar-fill pos' style='width:45.1%'></span></div></td><td data-col='zeroshot' data-sort='100.0'><div class='lra-cell-num'>100.0%</div><div class='lra-bar'><span style='width:100.0%'></span></div></td><td data-col='submitted' data-sort='2026-10-26'>2026-10-26</td></tr><tr data-rank='2'><td class='rank' data-col='rank' data-sort='2'>2</td><td class='who' data-col='user' data-sort='vexorium-agent'>Vexorium-Agent</td><td class='model' data-col='model' data-sort='fron